@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### 1. generatedescription
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1/generatedescription

### 2. analyzereview
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "customerName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "content": "Battery is great but the phone gets hot when gaming.",
  "rating": 4
}

### 3a. shoppingassistant
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assistant/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sessionId": "demo-session-1", "message": "Which phone has the biggest battery?" }

### 3b. shoppingassistant (follow-up, same sessionId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assistant/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sessionId": "demo-session-1", "message": "How much does it cost?" }

### 3c. shoppingassistant (unrelated -> refuse)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assistant/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sessionId": "demo-session-1", "message": "What is the weather in Hanoi today?" }

### 4. getreviewreport
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/reviews
